          "text": "   So we need to manually build the game according to the [Manual Building Guide](https://github.com/MorsGames/sm64plus/wiki/Manual-Building-Guide). The only thing we need to do differently is to use the command `git clone https://github.com/MorsGames/sm64plus.git --branch dev` in step 4 instead."
