          "text": "\t\t\t\t\"First, we need to download MSYS2. Press <SPACE> to head to the download page.\\n\\nOnce downloaded, run the installer, and click \\\"Next\\\" until the installation is complete. If you want to change the installation folder, keep in mind that installing it to any drive other than C might cause issues.\\n\\n\" +"
